  "title": "The Best Macaroni Cucumber Salad",
  "description": "This macaroni cucumber salad features canned tuna, chopped eggs, and tomatoes mixed with store-bought creamy salad dressing for a tasty picnic dish.",
  "authors": [
    "nyghtspydr"
  ],
